Package: raffalib
Version: 0.1
Date: 2026-05-10
Title: Miscellaneous Utilities for Tables, Plots and Models
Description: A personal collection of helper functions used regularly by the
    author for empirical research workflows in R: building publication-ready
    tables (modelsummary, gtsummary, flextable) and exporting them to Word,
    saving base R and ggplot2 plots to .docx, descriptive-statistics and
    data-wrangling shortcuts, list/vector/data-frame utilities, formula
    manipulation, and a set of helpers around glmmTMB (alternative optimizers
    and control-function 2SLS).
